"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["費用はかかりません。申告時に項目にチェックを入れるか、一度届出書類を提出するだけです。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["『個人所得税法』第五条：「次のいずれかに該当する場合、個人所得税を軽減することができる。具体的な幅および期間は、省、自治区、直轄市の人民政府が規定し、同級の人民代表大会常務委員会に報告して備え置くものとする：（一）障害者、孤児、および烈士の遺族の所得；（二）自然災害により重大な損失を被った場合。」『障害者保障法』第三十六条では、個人事業に従事する障害者に対し、法律に基づき税制優遇措置を適用し、行政事業性收费を免除すると別途規定されています（全国、個人所得税法は 2019 年 1 月 1 日より施行）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中华人民共和国个人所得税法（2018 年修正，第五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf724bd0609","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf724bd0609"]},"；中华人民共和国残疾人保障法（第三十六条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f135f46016f1d134c88132b","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080816f135f46016f1d134c88132b"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf724bd0609","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["収益の規模を「小」としている理由は、法律自体に具体的な数字が示されておらず、多くの省における軽減額は年間数百から数千元程度の規模であるためです。金額はそれほど大きくありませんが、一度手続きを行えば長期的に適用されるため、手続きを行う価値はあります。お住まいの省で具体的にいくら軽減されるかは、現地の税務局の公告のみが正確であり、ネット上で転載されている対照表は期限切れであることが多いため注意してください。個人商店を経営している場合は、『障害者保障法』第三十六条に基づき、行政事業性收费が免除されますので、免許等の申請時に自ら申し出てください。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/ja/tip/33-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["前へ"]},"中国で仕事を探すときは障害者証の所持を伝える。採用で企業の負担金を減らせる"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/33-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"盲導犬は公共施設や公共交通機関への同伴が可能で、視覚障害者は市内のバスに無料で乗車できます"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["障害者手帳の交付後、県級の残聯（障害者連合会）へ行き、申請可能な事項を一度にすべて確認する"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["障害者手帳自体に現金が支給されるわけではなく、それは「鍵」のようなものです。その後に続くのは、それぞれ独立した複数の手当であり、その一つひ…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["7 歳未満で、新たに障害や自閉症（孤独症）が判明した子供については、県級の残聯へリハビリ救済を申請する"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["国は、0 歳から 6 歳までの障害児および自閉症児に対し、手術、補助器具、リハビリ訓練をカバーするリハビリ救済制度を構築しています。救済対…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["自宅のスロープ、手すり、浴室のリフォームについては、県級以上の政府に補助金を申請できる"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["《無障礙環境建設法》には、「県級以上の政府は、家庭内のバリアフリー化改修を支援・指導すべきであり、条件を満たす障害者および高齢者の家庭に対…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["障害のある受験生は大学入試（高考）において合理的配慮を申請でき、点字答案を使用する場合、試験時間は1.5倍に延長される"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["障害のある受験生は、大学入試（高考）において、点字答案、拡大文字答案、外国語リスニング免除、別室受験、補聴器や車椅子の持ち込み、および試験…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["障害のある子供の入学申請に対し、学校は拒否してはならない。登校が困難な場合は、教育局が訪問指導の手配を行う"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["幼稚園および各種学校は、条件を満たす障害のある子供の入学申請を拒否してはならず、普通科・職業学校も同様です。介助が必要で登校が困難な子供に…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/33-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["右下肢または両下肢を欠損していても運転免許の取得は可能。準拠車種は C5 と呼ばれる"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["右下肢または両下肢を欠損している、あるいは動かせない場合でも、自力で安定して座ることができ、上肢の条件を満たしている人は、障害者専用のオー…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/33"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：障害を負った後の生き方"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-label":"広告 · コミュニティ紹介"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-brand"},"children":[{"tag":"img","props":{"src":"/sites/howtolivebetter/images/shengcai/logo.png","width":"565","height":"144","alt":"生財有術の公式ロゴ","decoding":"async"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-copy"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-ad-space-label"},"children":["広告 · コミュニティ紹介"]},{"tag":"st